  "all_exact_matches_pass": true,
  "notes": "All ten raw-note files and ten snapshots were read before generating themes. Exactness means matching the supplied notes, not verification against a recording. No numerical emotional ratings were invented.",
  "quotes": [
    {
      "quote_number": 1,
      "interview_id": "CR01",
      "quote_original_chinese": "整理其实没多久，主要是等人，断断续续拖了几天。",
      "repository_source": "teams/stark-labs/hw3-interviews/raw-notes/CR01.md",
      "source_line": 10,
      "source_character_start": 484,
      "source_character_end_exclusive": 507,
      "source_sha256": "7aec082f3a7591a93e392803f4175134a5b90142d574c9876e39922d448bd4f3",
      "literal_match_in_original_chinese_section": true,
      "original_chinese_occurrences": 1,
      "english_rendering_status": "Labeled translation; not an original English utterance.",
      "source_status": "Team-supplied notes; not audio-verified transcript.",
      "package_source": "raw-notes/CR01.md"
    },
    {
      "quote_number": 2,
      "interview_id": "CR02",
      "quote_original_chinese": "最麻烦的不是收不到内容，是有人写得特别长，有人就写两句话，放在一起很不统一。",
      "repository_source": "teams/stark-labs/hw3-interviews/raw-notes/CR02.md",
      "source_line": 10,
      "source_character_start": 437,
      "source_character_end_exclusive": 475,
      "source_sha256": "4a83014963117de98cf0479705996482caee41b0aab266d0e70b16573763d3d6",
      "literal_match_in_original_chinese_section": true,
      "original_chinese_occurrences": 1,
      "english_rendering_status": "Labeled translation; not an original English utterance.",
      "source_status": "Team-supplied notes; not audio-verified transcript.",
      "package_source": "raw-notes/CR02.md"
    },
    {
      "quote_number": 3,
      "interview_id": "CR05",
      "quote_original_chinese": "他一开始说内容都准备好了，但后来给我的其实是一个很长的文档，还有一堆图片，我要自己判断哪些放首页、哪些不用。",
      "repository_source": "teams/stark-labs/hw3-interviews/raw-notes/CR05.md",
      "source_line": 10,
      "source_character_start": 448,
      "source_character_end_exclusive": 502,
      "source_sha256": "784c717177b82b64d4100fc52ed5361fb5eef0d1bb8b458ac9ce3d249fa5963a",
      "literal_match_in_original_chinese_section": true,
      "original_chinese_occurrences": 1,
      "english_rendering_status": "Labeled translation; not an original English utterance.",
      "source_status": "Team-supplied notes; not audio-verified transcript.",
      "package_source": "raw-notes/CR05.md"
    },
    {
      "quote_number": 4,
      "interview_id": "ST02",
      "quote_original_chinese": "比起便宜一点，我更在意它会不会给我一个看起来很对、其实错了的结果。",
      "repository_source": "teams/stark-labs/hw3-interviews/raw-notes/ST02.md",
